Package: provtrace
Type: Package
Title: Provenance-Integrated Bioinformatics Visualization
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Iman", "Sadeghi", email = "i.sadeghi@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Embeds analysis provenance (preprocessing, parameter, and method choices) directly inside the biological result figure, so result fragility under pipeline perturbation is visible at a glance.
    Part of the bioviz suite of ten complementary visualization modules
    for advanced bioinformatics analysis and publication-grade figures.
